<title>USA: Advanced Plant sets dividend, not split.</title>
<headline>Advanced Plant sets dividend, not split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Plant Pharmaceuticals Inc said Monday it would declare a one-for-one stock dividend instead of its previously announced two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>It said it was postponing the operation to late October from September 20.</p>
<p>The company said it wanted to wait until a majority of its shareholders had approved an increase in authorized shares.</p>
<p>It said it would announce new record and pay dates for the stock dividend upon approval.</p>
</text>
